    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Alonzo King working with Summer Program students at Alonzo King Lines Ballet on Thursday, July 11, 2019 in San Francisco, Calif. Each summer, Lines Ballet have hundreds of dancers from across the country audition and attend the dance company's intensive summer training session.Alonzo generously works with these students in the studio and it is such a special experience. His approach and and voice are so important for all our students - but also in the larger dance landscape."
